@startuml autonomous-product-operations-boundary
title Autonomous Product / Autonomous Operations Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §11 + §13

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Product" as AP
class "Autonomous Operations" as AO

AP --> AO : may depend on / use

note right
  Per ADR-ES-017 §11 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-004 + APROD-AUTO-NEG-013:
  - Autonomous Operations represents the operating environment
  - Autonomous Operations is NOT a Product subtype
  - Autonomous Product is NOT Autonomous Operations
  - Autonomous Operations does NOT automatically make every Product autonomous
end note

@enduml
